<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<topic id="quiz-mixed" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
    xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:oasis:names:tc:dita:xsd:topic.xsd">
    <title>Mixed Quiz Questions</title>
    <body>
        <p>This quiz demonstrates a mix of multiple-choice questions (with ordered lists) and numeric questions (with tolerance values).</p>
        <p>
            <simpletable frame="all" relcolwidth="2.0* 0.5* 2.0*" outputclass="qd-quiz">
                <sthead>
                    <stentry>Question</stentry>
                    <stentry>Answer</stentry>
                    <stentry>Detail</stentry>
                </sthead>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the primary function of a sonar system?</stentry>
                    <stentry>3</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>To navigate using stars</li>
                            <li>To communicate with other vessels</li>
                            <li>To detect underwater objects using sound waves</li>
                            <li>To measure water depth only</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>At what frequency (in kHz) does a typical hull-mounted sonar operate?</stentry>
                    <stentry>5</stentry>
                    <stentry>0.5</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Which type of sonar uses reflections to detect objects?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Active sonar</li>
                            <li>Passive sonar</li>
                            <li>Side-scan sonar</li>
                            <li>Doppler sonar</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the speed of sound in seawater (in m/s)?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1500</stentry>
                    <stentry>50</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Which component converts electrical signals into sound waves?</stentry>
                    <stentry>2</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Receiver</li>
                            <li>Transducer</li>
                            <li>Display</li>
                            <li>Amplifier</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the typical detection range (in nautical miles) for towed array sonar?</stentry>
                    <stentry>20</stentry>
                    <stentry>5</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What causes the thermocline effect in sonar propagation?</stentry>
                    <stentry>2</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Changes in salinity</li>
                            <li>Temperature gradients in water layers</li>
                            <li>Underwater currents</li>
                            <li>Seafloor composition</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
            </simpletable>
        </p>
    </body>
